  "releaseNotes": "NextGenSoftware.OASIS.API.Providers.ScyllaDBOASIS v2.0.3\n\nScyllaDB OASIS Provider — high-performance Cassandra-compatible database for OASIS holons and avatars via CassandraCSharpDriver. https://oasisomniverse.one\n\nWhat's new since v2.0.2\n- Add ScyllaDB CQL admission and acknowledged save ownership controls (c2a5d69)\n- Fix ScyllaDB tablet schema and verify original native CQL restart (f75173c)\n- Integrate verified ScyllaDB native storage (5d7468b)\n- MOVING DOCS AROUND (32a8004)\n- Validate GUID native keys before avatar deletion in forty adapters (597758b)\n\nFull changelog\nhttps://github.com/NextGenSoftwareUK/OASIS/commits/master/Providers/Storage/NextGenSoftware.OASIS.API.Providers.ScyllaDBOASIS",
